<Portfolio title="Privacy | Synthworx" description="How the Synthworx product index and Audience Cut handle website visits and film inquiries.">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="info">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>DNS Ventures LLC operates Synthworx. You can browse the product index without an account. Ordinary hosting logs may include request times, addresses and paths. Each product’s subsite provides information about how that product handles your data.</p>
    <h2>Product feedback</h2>
    <p>We store the product name, your note and any reply email you provide privately on Railway and send a copy to our team at hello@synthworx.com through Zoho Mail. We use this information to review feedback and respond if you ask for a reply.</p>
    <h2>Audience Cut inquiries</h2>
    <p>We use the name, email, working title and decision you submit to answer your inquiry and discuss a potential engagement. We store inquiries privately on Railway and send a copy to our team’s Zoho Mail inbox. Our team can access them to respond.</p>
    <h2>Film materials</h2>
    <p>Please use the form for an introduction only. Before we receive a film, we agree with the authorized representative on the NDA, transfer method, approved processing, access and deletion terms.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For a question about your information or a deletion request, email <a href="mailto:hello@synthworx.com">hello@synthworx.com</a>.</p>
  </div></div>
</Portfolio>
